# Wardens of the Cycle: "Morbid — At the beginning of your end step, if a creature died this turn, choose one — You gain 2 life; or
# You draw a card and you lose 1 life." Bot1 casts the Wardens off Mox Jet, Mox Emerald, Mox Pearl and a Forest. On turn 2 Bot2
# casts an Ornithopter; on turn 3 Bot1 kills it with Lightning Bolt (a creature of the opponent's dies: morbid counts any creature),
# and at the end step chooses the first mode: 2 life, and no card drawn.

